            "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"uk\">\n  <head><!-- ✨🧞‍♂️✨ 2 -->\n    <title>Founding Engineer (LLM, RAG, AI agents, Node.js) в DOIT Software – Djinni</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  <meta name=\"ahrefs-site-verification\" content=\"e3fb4f761d8fc47e3989aa951de60e8790deb948c9050a096c02e8c189ed4d54\">\n  <meta name=\"google-translate-customization\" content=\"43b319e88d47400c-2c58b02d438c987e-gbc703ae24e1d942c-9\"/>\n\n    \n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"We are looking for a Founding Engineer to join a fast-growing start-up developing a product for automated lead generation and recruitment outreach.\nThe...\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://djinni.co/jobs/834528-founding-engineer-llm-rag-ai-agents-node-js/\">\n  \n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \"@type\": \"JobPosting\", \"applicantLocationRequirements\": {\"@type\": \"AdministrativeArea\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressCountry\": null, \"addressLocality\": null, \"addressRegion\": \"Europe\", \"postalCode\": null}}, \"category\": \"ML AI\", \"datePosted\": \"2026-06-30T11:04:25.684973\", \"description\": \"We are looking for a Founding Engineer to join a fast-growing start-up developing a product for automated lead generation and recruitment outreach.\\nThe ideal candidate has previous startup experience and is passionate about building products from the ground up. We\\u2019re looking for someone who genuinely enjoys coding, solving complex technical challenges, taking ownership, and moving fast in a high-impact environment.\\n \\nAbout the Role\\nWe are specifically looking for a Founding Engineer who is skilled enough to drive architecture and infrastructure decisions while remaining deeply hands-on in development.\\nThe key requirements are a startup mindset, ownership, autonomy, and strong technical execution.\\nYou\\u2019ll work directly with the founder on both technical and product decisions while helping to shape the company\\u2019s engineering culture and technical direction.\\n \\nWhat You\\u2019ll Do\\nArchitect, prototype, and build product features from scratch.\\nDevelop integrations with AI platforms (OpenAI, Perplexity, etc.).\\nBuild integrations with 3rd-party systems and CRMs.\\nDesign scalable backend services and APIs.\\nWork on AI agents, RAG systems, and prompt engineering.\\nDesign and optimize SQL databases.\\nBuild cloud-native infrastructure on AWS/GCP/Azure.\\nImplement asynchronous task-processing patterns (RabbitMQ, SQS).\\nCollaborate directly with the founder on product and business decisions.\\nHelp define technical standards and engineering best practices.\\nContribute to a fast-moving startup environment with high ownership.\\nRequirementsMust-Have\\nSenior-level software engineering experience\\n1+ year of startup experience (ideally direct hire at a start up)\\n5+ years of commercial development experience\\nStrong hands-on experience with:TypeScript\\nNode.js\\nREST APIs\\nJSON\\nGit\\n\\nExperience building AI agents, RAG systems, or LLM-powered products\\nStrong prompt engineering skills\\nExperience with API integrations\\nStrong SQL and database design skills\\nExperience with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or Azure)\\nUnderstanding of asynchronous systems and queues (RabbitMQ, SQS, or similar)\\nStrong communication skills and product mindset\\nHigh level of ownership and autonomy\\nNice-to-Have\\nPrevious CTO or technical leadership experience\\nExperience with n8n or Make\\nExperience building SaaS products\\nExperience scaling early-stage startups\\nInfrastructure and architecture leadership experience\\nWhat We Offer\\nFull-time engagement\\nFully remote work\\nLong-term cooperation\\nFounding member equity\\nOpportunity to directly influence company and product strategy\\nFast personal and professional growth\\nFreedom, ownership, and real responsibility\\nOpportunity to grow into a future CTO role\\nModern AI-first development environment (including Cursor Agent mode)\\nU.S. company contract\\nPaid vacation days\\nRecruitment Process\\nPre-screen with a recruitment manager\\nPre-screen call witht the startup founder\\nTechnical deep-dive interview with a small live coding session\\nCall to meet the team\\n\", \"directApply\": true, \"employmentType\": \"FULL_TIME\", \"estimatedSalary\": {\"@type\": \"MonetaryAmount\", \"currency\": \"USD\", \"maxValue\": 6000, \"minValue\": 3500}, \"experienceRequirements\": {\"@type\": \"OccupationalExperienceRequirements\", \"monthsOfExperience\": 60.0}, \"hiringOrganization\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"DOIT Software\", \"sameAs\": \"http://doit.software\"}, \"identifier\": 834528, \"industry\": \"saas\", \"jobLocationType\": \"TELECOMMUTE\", \"title\": \"Founding Engineer (LLM, RAG, AI agents, Node.js)\", \"url\": \"https://djinni.co/jobs/834528-founding-engineer-llm-rag-ai-agents-node-js/\", \"validThrough\": \"2026-07-30T11:04:25.684973\"}\n    </script>\n  \n\n\n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Founding Engineer (LLM, RAG, AI agents, Node.js) в DOIT Software \" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We are looking for a Founding Engineer to join a fast-growing start-up developing a product for automated lead generation and recruitment outreach.<br>The ideal candidate has previous startup...\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://djinni.co/jobs/834528-founding-engineer-llm-rag-ai-agents-node-js/\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://p.djinni.co/8e/c3eda93b43aeab9e6cdb9c469730ed/Znimok_ekrana_2023-05-29_o_13.49.13_400.png\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description