  <div>\n                <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-1\">\n                   <a\n                    href=\"https://djinni.co/jobs/company-doit-software/\"\n                    class=\"text-secondary fw-medium\"\n                  >\n                    DOIT Software\n                  </a>\n                  <span class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center column-gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" title=\"Компанія має підтверджені найми\">\n    \n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#patch-check-fill\"></use></svg>\n\n  </span></span>\n                </div>\n                \n                  <div class=\"d-flex column-gap-2 mt-1\">\n                    \n                    \n                      <div >\n                        \n  <a\n    href=\"/ajax/jobs_subs/company_subscribe/?job_id=834528\"\n    role=\"button\"\n    hx-post=\"/ajax/jobs_subs/company_subscribe/?job_id=834528\"\n    hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n  >\n    \n  <svg class=\"dj-ic dj-ic-bell \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/dj-icons-sprite.svg#dj-bell\"></use></svg>\n\n    Підписатись\n  </a>\n\n                      </div>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                      \n  \n\n  <a class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1 text-body\"\n    hx-post=\"/api/jobs/favorites/?macro=save_job\"\n      hx-vals='{ \"job_id\": 834528, \"referral\": \"detail\" }'\n    hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"\n    href=\"#\"\n    role=\"button\"\n  >\n    \n      \n  <svg class=\"dj-ic dj-ic-bookmark \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/dj-icons-sprite.svg#dj-bookmark\"></use></svg>\n Зберегти\n  </a>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                      \n  \n    <a href=\"#\" hx-post=\"/api/jobs/blocked/834528/?macro=hide_job\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" role=\"button\" class=\"icon-link text-body\">\n      <span>\n  <svg class=\"dj-ic dj-ic-minus-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/dj-icons-sprite.svg#dj-minus-circle\"></use></svg>\n Сховати</span>\n    </a>\n  \n\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-auto\">\n              <div class=\"fs-3 fw-bold\">\n                \n                  \n  \n    <span class=\"text-body-tertiary fw-medium\"\n      data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" \n      title=\"Рівень зарплати відносно інших вакансій: $ — нижче середнього, $$ — середній, $$$ — вище середнього, $$$$ — найвищий\"\n    >$$$$</span>\n  \n\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-2\">\n        \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n    <span class=\"badge text-bg-light\">\n      Продуктова компанія\n    </span>\n  \n\n      </div>\n\n        \n\n    </header>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-0 order-1\">\n        \n          <div class=\"mb-4 job-post__description\">\n            <p>We&nbsp;are looking for a&nbsp;<strong>Founding Engineer</strong> to&nbsp;join a&nbsp;fast-growing start-up developing a&nbsp;product for automated lead generation and recruitment outreach.</p><p>The ideal candidate has previous startup experience and is&nbsp;passionate about building products from the ground&nbsp;up. We’re looking for someone who genuinely enjoys coding, solving complex technical challenges, taking ownership, and moving fast in&nbsp;a&nbsp;high-impact environment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>About the Role</strong></p><p>We&nbsp;are specifically looking for a&nbsp;Founding Engineer who is&nbsp;skilled enough to&nbsp;drive architecture and infrastructure decisions while remaining deeply hands-on in&nbsp;development.</p><p>The key requirements are a&nbsp;startup mindset, ownership, autonomy, and strong technical execution.</p><p>You’ll work directly with the founder on&nbsp;both technical and product decisions while helping to&nbsp;shape the company’s engineering culture and technical direction.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p><ul><li>Architect, prototype, and build product features from scratch.</li><li>Develop integrations with&nbsp;AI platforms (OpenAI, Perplexity, etc.).</li><li>Build integrations with 3rd-party systems and CRMs.</li><li>Design scalable backend services and APIs.</li><li>Work on&nbsp;AI&nbsp;agents, RAG systems, and prompt engineering.</li><li>Design and optimize SQL&nbsp;databases.</li><li>Build cloud-native infrastructure on&nbsp;AWS/GCP/Azure.</li><li>Implement asynchronous task-processing patterns (RabbitMQ, SQS).</li><li>Collaborate directly with the founder on&nbsp;product and business decisions.</li><li>Help define technical standards and engineering best practices.</li><li>Contribute to&nbsp;a&nbsp;fast-moving startup environment with high ownership.</li></ul><p><strong>RequirementsMust-Have</strong></p><ul><li>Senior-level software engineering experience</li><li>1+&nbsp;year of&nbsp;startup experience (ideally direct hire at&nbsp;a&nbsp;start&nbsp;up)</li><li>5+&nbsp;years of&nbsp;commercial development experience</li><li>Strong hands-on experience with:<ul><li>TypeScript</li><li>Node.js</li><li>REST APIs</li><li>JSON</li><li>Git</li></ul></li><li>Experience building AI&nbsp;agents, RAG systems, or&nbsp;LLM-powered products</li><li>Strong prompt engineering skills</li><li>Experience with API integrations</li><li>Strong SQL and database design skills</li><li>Experience with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or&nbsp;Azure)</li><li>Understanding of&nbsp;asynchronous systems and queues (RabbitMQ, SQS, or&nbsp;similar)</li><li>Strong communication skills and product mindset</li><li>High level of&nbsp;ownership and autonomy</li></ul><p><strong>Nice-to-Have</strong></p><ul><li>Previous CTO or&nbsp;technical leadership experience</li><li>Experience with n8n or&nbsp;Make</li><li>Experience building SaaS products</li><li>Experience scaling early-stage startups</li><li>Infrastructure and architecture leadership experience</li></ul><p><strong>What We&nbsp;Offer</strong></p><ul><li>Full-time engagement</li><li>Fully remote work</li><li>Long-term cooperation</li><li>Founding member equity</li><li>Opportunity to&nbsp;directly influence company and product strategy</li><li>Fast personal and professional growth</li><li>Freedom, ownership, and real responsibility</li><li>Opportunity to&nbsp;grow into a&nbsp;future CTO role</li><li>Modern AI-first development environment (including Cursor Agent mode)</li><li>U.S. company contract</li><li>Paid vacation days</li></ul><p><strong>Recruitment Process</strong></p><ol><li>Pre-screen with a&nbsp;recruitment manager</li><li>Pre-screen call witht the startup founder</li><li>Technical deep-dive interview with a&nbsp;small live coding session</li><li>Call to&nbsp;meet the team</li></ol>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n          \n          \n          \n          <h2 class=\"fs-4\">Необхідний досвід з навичками</h2>\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            \n  <div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">SaaS</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">1 рік</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">Node.js</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">TypeScript</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">LLM</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">1.5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">RAG</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">1.5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n          </div>\n          \n            <div class=\"mt-n3 mb-3\">\n              <a class=\"text-primary fs-5\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" onclick=\"this.remove()\" href=\"#more_skills_exp\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"more_skills_exp\">\n                + ще 2\n              </a>\n              <div id=\"more_skills_exp\" class=\"collapse\">\n                \n  <div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">MCP Servers</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">1.5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"mb-2\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--skills csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#mortarboard\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">AI Agents Development</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">1.5 років</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n\n      </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            \n            \n            \n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"fs-4\">Вимоги до володіння мовами</h2>\n              <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                \n                  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <span class=\"csc csc--language csc--readonly csc--compact\">\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__icon\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#translate\"></use></svg>\n</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"csc__primary\">Англійська</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"csc__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"csc__secondary\">B2 – Вище середнього</span>\n    \n    \n  </span>\n</div>\n                \n              </div>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"row gx-2 text-secondary fs-5\">\n              <div class=\"col-auto\">\n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg text-secondary me-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#tags\"></use></svg>\n</div>\n              <div class=\"col\">JSON, Git, REST API, n8n, Make</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            \n  \n  \n    \n    \n    \n  \n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"ck-editor-text\">\n    <h4>Про компанію DOIT Software</h4>\n\n    \n      <p>DOIT Software — IT Staff Augmentation company. We work with clients worldwide (primarily the USA, Canada, EU, and UK). DOIT has strong expertise in hiring engineers based on our 10 years of software development experience. We are a result-oriented team looking for hard-working professionals to join our growth journey. DOIT has built many internal processes that will be a good starting point. However, we have room for creativity and professional development, improving and streamlining the work to achieve better results.</p>\n      <br>\n    \n    \n    \n      <a\n        href=\"/jobs/company-doit-software/\"\n        class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary my-3 js-analytics-event\"\n        data-analytics=\"company_page\"\n        data-recruiter-id=\"146735\"\n        data-json-parameter='{ \"action\": \"view_page_button_click\" }'\n      >\n        Сторінка компанії\n      </a>\n      \n\n    \n      <br>\n      <strong>Сайт компанії:</strong><br>\n      <a href=\"http://doit.software\" target=\"_blank\">\n      http://doit.software</a><br>\n    \n\n    \n      <br>\n      <strong>Сторінка компанії на DOU:</strong><br>\n      <a href=\"https://jobs.dou.ua/companies/doit-software/?from=djinni_job\" target=\"_blank\">\n      https://jobs.dou.ua/companies/doit-software/</a><br>\n    \n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  \n\n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            \n\n\n<div id=\"job-publication-info\">\n  <div class=\"mb-1\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"font-weight-500\">Опубліковано 30 червня</span>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fs-5\">\n      <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-1\">\n        <div>\n          24 перегляди\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"px-1 text-secondary\"><span class=\"middot\"> · </span></div>\n        <div>\n          4 відгуки\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n        \n        \n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap column-gap-3\">\n          \n          \n            <div\n              data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"\n              title=\"16:11 14.04.2026\"\n            >\n              \n  \n    \n    \n    \n    <span class=\"dot bg-secondary\"></span>\n  \n Відповідали більше місяця тому\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n          \n        \n\n        \n          <div id=\"apply_job\"></div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n    \n      \n      \n  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n    <strong>\n      Ваш профіль не відповідає деяким вимогам, вказаним компанією\n    </strong>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card card-body mb-1\">\n    \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <ul class=\"job-matching-info list-unstyled list-mb-3 font-size-small mb-0\">\n    \n      <li>\n        <div class=\"row gx-2\">\n          <div class=\"col-auto\">\n            \n              \n  \n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg text-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#x-circle\"></use></svg>\n\n            \n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col\">\n            \n  \n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"font-weight-600 capitalize-first-letter\">\n      Виключно\n      \n      \n        від\n        5 років досвіду\n      \n    </strong>\n  </div>\n  \n\n            <div>\n              <small class=\"text-secondary\">\n                Ваш досвід: 3 роки досвіду\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n      \n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  </ul>\n\n  </div>\n  <small class=\"text-secondary font-size-extra-small\">\n    Якщо вважаєте, що все ж підходите — <a href=\"/my/profile\" target=\"_blank\">оновіть профіль</a> та спробуйте ще раз.\n  </small>\n\n    \n  \n \n        \n\n        \n          \n          \n            <div class=\"mb-4 mt-3\">\n              <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"text-danger flag-candidate-btn\">\n                \n  <svg class=\"bi bi-svg \" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"/static/icons/bootstrap-icons.svg#exclamation-triangle\"></use></svg>\n\n                Сповістити про проблему\n              </a>\n              \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"flag-candidate-form\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <form method=\"post\">\n      <h5>Сповістити про проблему</h5>\n      <p class=\"form-text\">Вакансія не відповідає дійсності? Шахрайство? Розкажіть, ми розберемося.</p>\n      <textarea\n        name=\"flag_msg\"\n        rows=\"3\"\n        data-min-rows=\"3\"\n        required\n        class=\"input form-control keysubmit flag-textarea js-auto-resize\"\n        style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"></textarea>\n      <input type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light\" name=\"flag\"\n        value=\"Повідомити\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-link flag-candidate-dont-btn\"\n        >Не повідомляти</a>\n      <input type='hidden' name='csrfmid